# Public code-only snapshot policy.
# Use with: git -c core.excludesFile=.gitignore.code-only check-ignore --no-index <path>
#
# Everything is excluded by default.  Only application source, project files,
# solution metadata, and the two required Windows application manifests are
# allowed into a code-only snapshot.
*
!*/
!**/*.cs
!**/*.xaml
!**/*.csproj
!**/*.slnx
!/Package.appxmanifest
!/app.manifest
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/Assets/Icons/IDVB_icon_square_master.png
!/Assets/Guide/control-panel-start.png
!/Assets/Guide/quick-scan-map-open.png
!/Assets/Guide/quick-scan-select-map.png
!/Assets/Guide/switch-floor.png
